__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.env
/models
data/raw/
*.onnx
!artifacts/candidates/**/*.onnx
# Per-item progress of the resumable equivalence run (the committed report holds its results).
reports/**/*.progress.jsonl
reports/**/*.rowcache.jsonl

# Adaptive attacker (milestone adaptive-attacker): the API-response cache and raw per-query
# transcripts may contain full candidate bodies and token usage; they are never committed. The
# cache stores response bodies keyed by a request hash that excludes all headers (no API key, no
# auth), but it is still local-only. Committed outputs are the small summary JSONs under
# reports/adaptive-attacker/ and the labelled probe set under fixtures/probes/.
.sentinel.env
redteam/adaptive/cache/
reports/adaptive-attacker/**/queries.jsonl
reports/adaptive-attacker/**/transcripts/
reports/adaptive-attacker/**/*.raw.jsonl
